ement tender of Night Vision Goggles in the history of a European NATO member, for over 100,000 NVGs to Belgian and German Armed Forces, valued at ~€1 billion. ΤΗΕΟΝ ΙΝΤΕRNATIONAL PLC has been listed on Euronext Amsterdam ","AMS:THEON"," since February 2024."]},{"type":"p","children":["www.theon.com"]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Attachment"]}]},{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"*","children":["Press Release_H1 2026 announcement _ vF"]}]}]},"language":"en","tags":[{"title":"Earnings","args":[{"id":"section","value":"earnings"}]},{"title":"GlobeNewswire","args":[{"id":"provider","value":"globenewswire"}]},{"title":"Greek stocks","args":[{"id":"category","value":"stock"},{"id":"market_country","value":"GR"}]},{"title":"Strategy, business, and products","args":[{"id":"section","value":"strategy_business_products"}]}],"robots":["noindex"],"id":"globenewswire:a5975ffa2094b:0","title":"Publication of H1 2026 Report","published":1788808200,"urgency":2,"link":"https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2026/09/07/3357256/0/en/publication-of-h1-2026-report.html","relatedSymbols":[{"symbol":"EURONEXT:THEON","logoid":"theon-international-plc","logo":{"style":"single","logoid":"theon-international-plc"}}],"storyPath":"/news/globenewswire:a5975ffa2094b:0-publication-of-h1-2026-report/","read_time":162,"provider":{"id":"globenewswire","name":"GlobeNewswire","logo_id":"rdp-gnw","url":"https://www.globenewswire.com/"}}